task_id: sql_0032
task_type: sql
instruction: "The SQLite database 'Database for tasks.sqlite3' in the current directory has tables: CATEGORY(WARE, CLASS) - which category (CLASS) a ware belongs to (a ware may belong to several categories); MANUFACTURER(BILL_ID, COMPANY) - bills of materials and the companies owning them; MATERIAL(BILL_ID, WARE, AMOUNT) - materials used by a bill; PRODUCT(BILL_ID, WARE, AMOUNT, PRICE) - wares produced by a bill, with amount and price. A bill may produce several wares. Show the list of all the 'greedy' companies: companies selling all the wares they produce with prices at least 20% higher than the average price of this ware on the market (the average over all product records of the ware; every price the company has for every ware it produces must be at least 20% above that average). Write one company name per line, sorted alphabetically. Compute the answer with bash (sqlite3 and/or python3). Work only inside the current directory. When you are done, write ONLY the final answer to the file answer.txt in the current directory (for example with bash: echo 42 > answer.txt)."
reward: 1
expected: "AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL SERVICES\nAcme United Corporation.\nAllegion plc\nAmeresco\nAshland Inc.\nAvnet\nB/E Aerospace\nBank of the Ozarks\nBitauto Holdings Limited\nBlucora\nCardinal Financial Corporation\nCareer Education Corporation\nCascade Bancorp\nCeragon Networks Ltd.\nCheetah Mobile Inc.\nDataram Corporation\nEastern Virginia Bankshares\nElectronics for Imaging\nHDFC Bank Limited\nHanesbrands Inc.\nIcahn Enterprises L.P.\nJabil Circuit\nLifePoint Health\nMFRI\nMarin Software Incorporated\nMarineMax\nMazor Robotics Ltd.\nMetabolix\nMetro Bancorp\nMonro Muffler Brake\nNCR Corporation\nNortheast Community Bancorp\nOtter Tail Corporation\nParke Bancorp\nParkway Properties\nPreferred Apartment Communities\nRuby Tuesday\nSPAR Group\nSanchez Production Partners LP\nSeres Therapeutics\nSouthern First Bancshares\nSouthwestern Energy Company\nStrategic Hotels & Resorts Inc\nTSR\nTasman Metals Ltd\nTeekay Offshore Partners L.P.\nUnique Fabricating\nVBI Vaccines Inc.\nWGL Holdings Inc\nWSI Industries Inc.\nvoxeljet AG"
check: exact_str